      "id": "VAL-FORM-007",
      "title": "Plus code validation on blur (optional field)",
      "status": "fail",
      "steps": [
        {
          "action": "Clear localStorage, reload start.html",
          "expected": "Clean form state",
          "observed": "Page reloaded with clean state"
        },
        {
          "action": "Focus #storePlusCode, leave empty, blur",
          "expected": "No error shown (optional field)",
          "observed": "plusCodeErrorDisplay='none', plusCodeHasError=false — CORRECT"
        },
        {
          "action": "Focus #storePlusCode, type '849VCWC8+R9', blur",
          "expected": "Value accepted (uppercased), no error",
          "observed": "plusCodeErrorDisplay='block', plusCodeErrorText='Invalid Plus Code format (e.g., 849VCWC8+R9)', plusCodeHasError=true — FAIL: Global plus code format rejected by regex"
        },
        {
          "action": "Focus #storePlusCode, type 'bad code!!!', blur",
          "expected": "#plusCodeError shows 'Invalid Plus Code format', input has input-error class",
          "observed": "plusCodeErrorDisplay='block', plusCodeErrorText='Invalid Plus Code format (e.g., 849VCWC8+R9)', plusCodeHasError=true — CORRECT"
        },
        {
          "action": "Focus #storePlusCode, type 'CWC8+R9' (short format), blur",
          "expected": "Value accepted, no error",
          "observed": "plusCodeValue='CWC8+R9', plusCodeErrorDisplay='none', plusCodeHasError=false — CORRECT (hideError mapping works)"
        }
      ],
      "evidence": {
        "screenshots": ["start-app-extraction/form-validation-fix/VAL-FORM-007-pluscode-validation.png"],
        "consoleErrors": "none",
        "jsEvaluation": {
          "emptyValue": {
            "plusCodeError.style.display": "none",
            "storePlusCode.classList.contains('input-error')": false
          },
          "globalFormat_849VCWC8+R9": {
            "plusCodeError.style.display": "block",
            "plusCodeError.textContent": "Invalid Plus Code format (e.g., 849VCWC8+R9)",
            "storePlusCode.classList.contains('input-error')": true,
            "note": "FAIL: Regex /^[A-Z0-9]{2,4}\\+[A-Z0-9]{2,3}$/i only allows 2-4 chars before +, but global format has 8 chars"
          },
          "invalidFormat_badcode": {
            "plusCodeError.style.display": "block",
            "plusCodeError.textContent": "Invalid Plus Code format (e.g., 849VCWC8+R9)",
            "storePlusCode.classList.contains('input-error')": true
          },
          "shortFormat_CWC8+R9": {
            "plusCodeValue": "CWC8+R9",
            "plusCodeError.style.display": "none",
            "storePlusCode.classList.contains('input-error')": false,
            "note": "hideError('plusCodeError') mapping works correctly after fix"
          }
        }
      },
      "issues": "The showError/hideError fix (errorToInputMap) is working correctly for plusCodeError — errors show and hide properly on the correct input element. However, the validation contract specifies that '849VCWC8+R9' (global Plus Code format) should be accepted, but the validatePlusCode() regex only supports short format (2-4 chars before '+'). The regex is /^[A-Z0-9]{2,4}\\+[A-Z0-9]{2,3}$/i which rejects the 8-character prefix in global Plus Codes. This is a pre-existing behavior mismatch between the contract specification and the code implementation, NOT a regression from the showError/hideError fix."
    }
