  "summary": "Re-tested 4 assertions after showError/hideError input ID mapping fix. VAL-FORM-004 (phone), VAL-FORM-005 (email), VAL-FORM-006 (hours) all PASS — the fix correctly maps error elements to input elements. VAL-FORM-007 (plus code) FAILS for a different reason: the validatePlusCode regex only supports short-format Plus Codes (2-4 chars before '+'), but the contract specifies global format '849VCWC8+R9' (8 chars before '+') should be accepted. The hideError/showError mapping itself works correctly for plusCodeError. The fail is a pre-existing contract/code mismatch, not a regression from the fix."
